WEBVTT

00:00:02.494 --> 00:00:04.458
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off --

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:06.673
Saving people, hunting things.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.046
The family business.

00:00:11.082 --> 00:00:14.008
I have these nightmares,
and sometimes they come true.

00:00:14.008 --> 00:00:15.642
Come again?

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:18.157
I dreamt about jessica's
death before it happened.

00:00:18.157 --> 00:00:20.812
A vision. Started out as nightmares.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.626
Then he started having
them while he was awake.

00:00:22.626 --> 00:00:25.953
The closer I get to anything involving
the demon, the stronger the visions get.

00:00:25.953 --> 00:00:29.611
The demon said he had plans
for me and the children like me.

00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:31.354
Do you have any idea
what he meant by that?

00:00:31.354 --> 00:00:32.667
No,I don'T.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.703
Max,your abilities -They started
six,seven months ago,right?

00:00:35.703 --> 00:00:36.505
How'd you know that?

00:00:36.505 --> 00:00:38.509
'Cause that's when my abilities started.

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:39.852
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:39.852 --> 00:00:41.796
You and I are chosen.

00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:43.830
For what? I don't know.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.438
The thing I don't get is why.
I guess because we're so alike?

00:00:47.438 --> 00:00:49.803
Max is nothing like you.
Sam,max is a monster.

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:51.757
He's already killed two people.
Now he's gunning for a third.

00:00:56.076 --> 00:00:57.789
Did he say anything to you?

00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:59.543
No.

00:00:59.964 --> 00:01:02.249
Nothing.

00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:26.980
Hello? Yeah.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.798
All right.

00:01:56.813 --> 00:01:59.488
Afternoon,dennis. Hey,doc.

00:01:59.739 --> 00:02:01.723
I'd like to look at a gun.

00:02:02.464 --> 00:02:04.689
Yeah,right,doc.

00:02:06.032 --> 00:02:08.166
Seriously?

00:02:17.055 --> 00:02:19.039
That one.

00:02:21.314 --> 00:02:23.318
Okay.

00:02:25.222 --> 00:02:29.210
That's a turkey hunter.
12-Gauge. Pump-Action.

00:02:29.841 --> 00:02:32.156
Don't leave enough turkey
behind,if you ask me.

00:02:33.329 --> 00:02:37.247
What,uh,what sort of shells does it use?

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.303
Right here.

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:43.831
I'm taking the boys up to the
cabin this weekend,if you're,uh...

00:02:44.953 --> 00:02:47.879
I mean,if you think you might
like to take up the sport.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.973
Thanks,but no.

00:02:50.264 --> 00:02:52.519
You know guns make me
nervous. Always have.

00:02:52.519 --> 00:02:54.413
This one goes in here, right?

00:02:54.413 --> 00:02:58.652
Whoa. Doc! No,no,you can't load a
weapon on the premises. It's illegal!

00:02:58.972 --> 00:03:00.245
It's okay,dennis. No,no.

00:03:00.245 --> 00:03:04.895
It's okay,dennis. It's all gonna be

00:03:06.097 --> 00:03:06.658
Okay.

00:03:06.658 --> 00:03:08.061
Doc!

00:03:09.123 --> 00:03:10.697
What's going on?

00:03:10.697 --> 00:03:14.174
No,no,it's okay. It's okay.

00:03:14.735 --> 00:03:18.573
It's all gonna be... okay.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.415
Sam,come on,zip it up. Let's hit the...

00:03:38.936 --> 00:03:40.699
Road.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.162
What?

00:03:58.476 --> 00:04:01.493
I don't know,man. Why don't we
just chill out,think about this?

00:04:03.978 --> 00:04:05.291
What's there to think about?

00:04:05.291 --> 00:04:07.646
Just don't know if going to the
roadhouse is the smartest idea.

00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:09.760
Dean,it's another
premonition. I know it.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.009
This is gonna happen,and ash can tell us where.
Plus it could have some connection with the demon.

00:04:14.009 --> 00:04:16.334
My visions always do. That's my point.

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:18.248
There's gonna be hunters
there. I don't know if --

00:04:18.248 --> 00:04:21.164
If going in and announcing that
you're some supernatural freak

00:04:21.164 --> 00:04:24.370
With a demonic connection
is the best thing,okay?

00:04:25.252 --> 00:04:27.236
So I'm a freak now?

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.714
You've always been a freak.

00:04:43.651 --> 00:04:45.865
Damn, little lady,
that was my room money.

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.390
Then I guess you're
taking a truck nap tonight.

00:04:49.092 --> 00:04:51.918
I'd have checked the high scores
before you put your money down.

00:04:53.421 --> 00:04:55.666
Went and got yourself hustled,ed.

00:05:06.037 --> 00:05:07.861
Just can't stay away,huh?

00:05:08.743 --> 00:05:10.457
Yeah,looks like. How you doing,jo?

00:05:10.457 --> 00:05:12.561
Where's ash? In his back room.

00:05:12.561 --> 00:05:14.585
Great. And I'm fine.

00:05:15.928 --> 00:05:18.714
Sorry. He's -We're kind
of on a bit of a timetable.

00:05:27.662 --> 00:05:28.725
Ash?

00:05:28.725 --> 00:05:32.142
The conditions that led to
the sharpsville tragedy...

00:05:32.142 --> 00:05:34.316
Hey,ash?

00:05:37.132 --> 00:05:39.056
Hey,dr. Badass?

00:05:42.724 --> 00:05:45.399
Sam. Dean.

00:05:45.931 --> 00:05:48.065
Sam and dean.

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:53.306
Hey,ash, um,we need your help.

00:05:53.306 --> 00:05:56.633
Hell,then, guess I need my pants.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:04.970
So,I got a match. It's the logo
for the blue ridge bus lines.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.924
Guthrie,oklahoma.

00:06:06.924 --> 00:06:11.444
Okay. Do me a favor. Check guthrie for any
demonic signs or omens or anything like that.

00:06:11.444 --> 00:06:14.179
You think the demon is there?

00:06:15.071 --> 00:06:16.264
Yeah. Maybe.

00:06:16.264 --> 00:06:19.761
Why would you think that?
Just check it,all right?

00:06:23.369 --> 00:06:26.315
No,sir,nothing. No demon.

00:06:27.898 --> 00:06:30.153
All right. Try something else for me.

00:06:30.153 --> 00:06:33.490
Search guthrie for a house
fire. It would be 1983.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:37.638
Fire's origin would be a baby's nursery,
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:06:42.669 --> 00:06:45.725
Okay,now, that is just weird,man.

00:06:45.725 --> 00:06:48.641
Why the hell would i
be looking for that?

00:06:51.477 --> 00:06:53.161
'Cause there's a pbr in it for you.

00:06:53.161 --> 00:06:55.816
Give me 15 minutes.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.742
What?

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:25.288
R.E.O. Speedwagon? Damn right,R.E.O.

00:07:25.679 --> 00:07:27.522
Kevin cronin sings it from the heart.

00:07:27.522 --> 00:07:30.178
He sings it from the
hair. There's a difference.

00:07:34.457 --> 00:07:36.782
That profile you've got ash looking for?

00:07:37.874 --> 00:07:40.129
Your mom died the
same way, didn't she --

00:07:40.129 --> 00:07:42.594
The fire in sam's nursery?

00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:46.141
Look,jo,it's kind of a
family thing. I could help.

00:07:46.141 --> 00:07:49.709
I'm sure you could,but we got
to handle this one ourselves.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.807
Besides,if I ran off with you,
think your mother might kill me.

00:07:56.934 --> 00:07:58.667
You're afraid of my mother?

00:07:58.667 --> 00:08:00.501
I think so.

00:08:00.972 --> 00:08:02.455
We have a match. We got to go.

00:08:02.455 --> 00:08:05.071
All right,jo, see you later.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:14.931
And even as I wander
I'm keeping you in sight

00:08:15.412 --> 00:08:21.695
You're a candle in the window
on a cold,dark winter's night

00:08:21.695 --> 00:08:26.836
And I'm getting closer
than I ever thought

00:08:26.836 --> 00:08:28.870
I mi-Ight

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.736
You're kidding,right?

00:08:32.538 --> 00:08:36.075
I heard the song somewhere. I can't get it out
of my head. I don't know,man. What do you got?

00:08:39.212 --> 00:08:40.795
Andrew gallagher.

00:08:40.795 --> 00:08:44.252
Born in '83,like me.

00:08:44.252 --> 00:08:47.219
Lost his mother in a nursery
fire exactly six months later,

00:08:47.219 --> 00:08:48.391
Also like me.

00:08:48.391 --> 00:08:50.085
You think the demon killed his mom?

00:08:50.085 --> 00:08:50.987
Sure looks like it.

00:08:50.987 --> 00:08:52.279
How did you know to look for this guy?

00:08:52.279 --> 00:08:54.454
Every premonition I've had,
if they're not about the demon,

00:08:54.454 --> 00:08:56.829
They're about the other
kids the demon visited.

00:08:56.829 --> 00:08:58.192
Like max miller. Remember him?

00:08:58.192 --> 00:09:00.807
Yeah,but max miller was
a basic little psycho.

00:09:00.807 --> 00:09:04.154
Point is he was killing people,and I was
having the same type of visions about him.

00:09:04.154 --> 00:09:06.820
And now it could be happening all
over again with this gallagher guy.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:08.353
How do we find him? I don't know.

00:09:08.353 --> 00:09:10.898
No current address,
no current employment.

00:09:10.898 --> 00:09:14.135
Still owes money on all his
bills -Phone,credit,utilities.

00:09:14.135 --> 00:09:16.119
Collection agency flags?

00:09:16.119 --> 00:09:17.602
Not in the system.

00:09:17.602 --> 00:09:19.306
They just let him take a walk?

00:09:19.306 --> 00:09:21.059
Seems like it.

00:09:21.059 --> 00:09:24.807
There's a work address from
his last w-2 about a year ago.

00:09:24.807 --> 00:09:26.861
Let's start there.

00:09:33.605 --> 00:09:37.273
You won't get anything out of
andy,guys. I'm sorry,but they never do.

00:09:37.965 --> 00:09:38.937
"They"?

00:09:38.937 --> 00:09:41.201
You're debt collectors, right?

00:09:41.201 --> 00:09:43.205
Once in a while, they come by.

00:09:43.205 --> 00:09:46.713
I don't know what andy says to
them, but they never come back.

00:09:47.434 --> 00:09:51.212
Actually,we're lawyers
representing his great-Aunt lita.

00:09:51.212 --> 00:09:55.130
She passed -God rest her soul
-But left andy a sizable estate.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.157
Yeah. So,are you a friend of his?

00:09:58.157 --> 00:10:01.634
I used to be,yeah. I don't
see much of andy anymore.

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:05.181
Andy? Andy kicks ass,man. Is that right?

00:10:05.181 --> 00:10:07.095
Yeah. Andy can get you into anything.

00:10:07.095 --> 00:10:10.031
He even got me backstage at
aerosmith once. It was beautiful,bro.

00:10:10.763 --> 00:10:13.449
How about busing a table or two,webber?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.785
Yeah,you bet,boss.

00:10:17.687 --> 00:10:20.403
Look,if you want to find
him, try orchard street.

00:10:20.403 --> 00:10:23.740
Just look for a van with the
barbarian queen painted on the side.

00:10:24.131 --> 00:10:25.263
Barbarian queen.

00:10:25.263 --> 00:10:28.420
She's riding a polar bear.
It's kind of hard to miss.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:36.426
I'm sorry. I'm starting to like
this dude. That van is sweet.

00:10:40.635 --> 00:10:43.431
What's wrong? Nothing.

00:10:43.431 --> 00:10:45.886
Sam,you look like you're
sucking on a lemon.

00:10:45.886 --> 00:10:49.774
This andrew gallagher -He's the
second guy like this we've found,dean.

00:10:50.115 --> 00:10:52.761
Demon came to them when they were
kids. Now they're killing people.

00:10:52.761 --> 00:10:55.226
We don't know what andrew
gallagher is. Could be innocent.

00:10:55.226 --> 00:10:56.759
My visions haven't been wrong yet.

00:10:56.759 --> 00:10:58.362
What's your point?

00:10:58.362 --> 00:11:01.459
My point is I'm one
of them. No,you're not.

00:11:01.459 --> 00:11:04.375
Dean,the demon said he had plans
for me and children like me.

00:11:04.375 --> 00:11:05.307
Yeah?

00:11:05.307 --> 00:11:09.285
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all a bunch of psychic freaks.

00:11:09.285 --> 00:11:11.059
Maybe we're all
supposed to be --

00:11:11.059 --> 00:11:12.021
Killers? Yeah.

00:11:12.021 --> 00:11:14.977
So the demon wants you out
there,killing with your minds?

00:11:15.478 --> 00:11:17.953
Give me a break. You're
not a murderer,sam!

00:11:17.953 --> 00:11:20.498
You don't have it in your bones.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.923
No?

00:11:24.397 --> 00:11:26.421
Last I checked, I kill
all kinds of things.

00:11:26.421 --> 00:11:28.756
Those things were asking for it.

00:11:28.756 --> 00:11:31.000
There's a difference.

00:11:43.967 --> 00:11:45.781
Got him.

00:12:13.379 --> 00:12:15.954
That's him,that older
guy. He's the shooter.

00:12:17.587 --> 00:12:20.413
Well,you keep on him.
I'll stick with andy.

00:13:08.233 --> 00:13:10.398
Hey! Hey.

00:13:10.398 --> 00:13:13.474
This is a cherry ride. Yeah. Thanks.

00:13:13.474 --> 00:13:17.733
Man,you know,'67 -Impala's
best year,if you ask me.

00:13:18.294 --> 00:13:19.527
This is a serious classic.

00:13:19.527 --> 00:13:23.385
You know,I just rebuilt her,too.
Can't let a car like this one go.

00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:25.068
Damn straight.

00:13:25.068 --> 00:13:27.964
Hey. Could I have it? Sure,man.

00:13:29.307 --> 00:13:31.271
Sweet.

00:13:31.271 --> 00:13:35.911
Hop right in there.
There you go. Very nice.

00:13:36.362 --> 00:13:38.606
Take it easy. All right.

00:13:51.493 --> 00:13:54.199
Hello? Yeah.

00:14:43.261 --> 00:14:46.328
Hello? Yeah.

00:14:49.144 --> 00:14:50.396
Dean, andy's got the impala!

00:14:50.396 --> 00:14:54.064
I know! He just sort of asked
me for it, and I let him take it.

00:14:54.064 --> 00:14:54.856
You what?

00:14:54.856 --> 00:14:58.503
He full-On obi-Wan'd me.
It's mind control,man.

00:15:17.383 --> 00:15:19.767
I kept him out of the gun store.

00:15:22.042 --> 00:15:24.217
I thought he was okay.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.914
I thought he was past it. At least...

00:15:29.418 --> 00:15:31.682
I should've stayed with him.

00:15:34.598 --> 00:15:37.234
Andy! What's up,dog?

00:15:38.837 --> 00:15:40.611
Andy.

00:15:41.503 --> 00:15:43.587
What are you doing here?

00:15:43.587 --> 00:15:47.245
D-Dr. Jennings.

00:15:47.666 --> 00:15:49.820
He's dead.

00:15:50.421 --> 00:15:53.127
Oh,no,I-I'm sorry.

00:15:53.127 --> 00:15:55.502
I don't know. I-I...

00:15:56.825 --> 00:16:01.374
I just -I was upset,
and I wanted to see you.

00:16:02.196 --> 00:16:05.914
Well,I'm glad you did. I,um...

00:16:08.439 --> 00:16:10.954
I missed you.

00:16:15.323 --> 00:16:18.771
Oh,you know what? Some guys were
here this morning,looking for you.

00:16:20.083 --> 00:16:22.168
What guys?

00:16:26.507 --> 00:16:28.401
Thank god!

00:16:31.016 --> 00:16:34.233
I'm sorry,baby. I'll
never leave you again.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.123
At least he left the keys in it.

00:16:39.123 --> 00:16:41.899
Yeah. Real samaritan,this guy.

00:16:41.899 --> 00:16:45.897
It looks like he can't work his mojo just by
twitching his nose. He's got to use verbal commands.

00:16:45.897 --> 00:16:49.665
The doctor had just gotten off his cellphone
when he stepped in front of that bus.

00:16:51.599 --> 00:16:53.623
Andy must've called him or something.

00:16:54.395 --> 00:16:56.990
I don't know. Maybe. Beg your pardon?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.423
I just don't know if he's our guy,sam.

00:16:58.423 --> 00:17:02.031
You had O.J. Convicted before he got out of
his bronco,and you have doubts about this?

00:17:02.031 --> 00:17:04.897
He doesn't seem like the
stone-Cold killer type. That's all.

00:17:04.897 --> 00:17:06.410
And O.J. Was guilty.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.835
Either way,how are we
gonna track this guy down?

00:17:10.879 --> 00:17:12.583
Not a problem.

00:17:13.926 --> 00:17:16.721
Not exactly an inconspicuous ride.

00:17:17.714 --> 00:17:19.177
Let's have a look.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:27.554
Oh,come on.

00:17:28.015 --> 00:17:32.124
This is -This is magnificent.
That's what this is.

00:17:32.855 --> 00:17:36.052
Not exactly a serial
killer's lair,though.

00:17:36.052 --> 00:17:39.629
There's no clown paintings on the walls

00:17:39.629 --> 00:17:42.215
Or scissors stuck in victims' photos.

00:17:42.215 --> 00:17:44.289
I like the tiger.

00:17:44.289 --> 00:17:47.145
Hegel? Kant?

00:17:47.145 --> 00:17:50.111
Wittgenstein? That's some
pretty heavy reading,dean.

00:17:50.111 --> 00:17:52.556
Yeah,and,uh...

00:17:52.556 --> 00:17:55.412
Moby dick's bong.

00:18:05.343 --> 00:18:08.079
You know,one day I'd
love to just sit down

00:18:08.079 --> 00:18:10.874
And eat something that I didn't
have to microwave at a minimart.

00:18:11.476 --> 00:18:14.742
What I don't get is the motive.
The doctor was squeaky clean.

00:18:14.742 --> 00:18:16.306
Why would andy waste him?

00:18:16.306 --> 00:18:17.949
If it is andy.

00:18:17.949 --> 00:18:20.003
Dude,enough. Why?

00:18:20.003 --> 00:18:22.449
The doctor was mind-Controlled
in front of a bus.

00:18:22.449 --> 00:18:25.836
Andy just happens to have the power
of mind control. You do the math.

00:18:25.836 --> 00:18:27.529
I don't think the guy has it in him.

00:18:27.529 --> 00:18:28.802
How the hell would you know?

00:18:28.802 --> 00:18:30.395
Why are you bending over
backwards defending him?

00:18:30.395 --> 00:18:31.477
'Cause you're not right about this.

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:33.091
About andy?

00:18:33.772 --> 00:18:35.586
Hey! You think I haven't seen you two?

00:18:35.586 --> 00:18:38.111
Why are you following me?

00:18:38.382 --> 00:18:40.416
Well,we're lawyers. A
relative of yours has --

00:18:40.416 --> 00:18:43.452
Tell the truth!
That's what --

00:18:43.533 --> 00:18:46.248
We hunt demons. What?

00:18:46.248 --> 00:18:49.936
Demons and spirits. Things your
worst nightmares wouldn't even touch.

00:18:49.936 --> 00:18:51.710
Sam's my brother. Dean,shut up.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.756
I'm trying. He's psychic,like
you. Well,not really like you.

00:18:54.756 --> 00:18:56.219
He thinks you're a murderer,

00:18:56.219 --> 00:18:59.766
And he's afraid he's gonna become one himself
cause you're all part of something that's terrible.

00:18:59.766 --> 00:19:03.404
I hope to hell that he's wrong, but I'm
starting to get scared he might be right.

00:19:03.755 --> 00:19:06.691
Okay,you know what? Just leave me alone.

00:19:07.082 --> 00:19:08.885
All right?

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:14.738
What are you doing?
Look,I-I said,leave me alone.

00:19:14.738 --> 00:19:17.754
Get out of here! Just start
driving and never stop!

00:19:17.754 --> 00:19:19.768
Doesn't seem to work on me,andy.

00:19:19.768 --> 00:19:21.131
What?

00:19:21.973 --> 00:19:23.736
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:19:23.736 --> 00:19:25.600
You can tell them what to think.

00:19:26.713 --> 00:19:27.614
That's crazy.

00:19:27.665 --> 00:19:29.839
All started a year ago, didn't it?

00:19:29.839 --> 00:19:33.677
After you turned 22. Little stuff at first,
then you got better at controlling it.

00:19:33.677 --> 00:19:34.850
How do you know all this?

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:38.407
'Cause the same thing happened to
me,andy. My mom died in a fire,too.

00:19:38.407 --> 00:19:40.992
I have abilities,too.

00:19:40.992 --> 00:19:42.455
You see,we're connected, you and me.

00:19:42.455 --> 00:19:44.540
Just -Just get out of here!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.225
Why did you tell the doctor
to walk in front of a bus?

00:19:47.225 --> 00:19:49.029
What?

00:19:56.374 --> 00:19:58.769
Why did you kill him? I didn'T.

00:20:07.147 --> 00:20:08.740
Hello?

00:20:10.764 --> 00:20:12.338
Sure.

00:20:13.159 --> 00:20:14.963
I can do that.

00:20:43.884 --> 00:20:45.477
Hey!

00:20:45.898 --> 00:20:48.203
Lady,what are you doing?!
It's gonna be okay.

00:20:49.475 --> 00:20:51.099
Lady,no. No!

00:21:03.334 --> 00:21:05.439
Sam? What is it?

00:21:05.439 --> 00:21:07.403
I didn't do anything to him.

00:21:10.629 --> 00:21:12.864
A woman. A woman burning alive.

00:21:12.864 --> 00:21:13.596
What else you get?

00:21:13.596 --> 00:21:15.960
A gas station. A woman
is gonna kill herself.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.393
What does he mean, "going to"?

00:21:17.393 --> 00:21:19.127
Shut up.

00:21:19.438 --> 00:21:21.382
She gets triggered
by a call on her cell.

00:21:21.382 --> 00:21:23.226
When? I don't know.

00:21:23.226 --> 00:21:25.901
As long as we keep our eyes on this
son of a bitch,he can't hurt her.

00:21:25.901 --> 00:21:28.076
I didn't hurt anybody! Yeah,not yet.

00:21:34.599 --> 00:21:36.103
Go.

00:21:36.553 --> 00:21:38.227
No. Not you.

00:21:38.407 --> 00:21:40.662
You're staying here with me.

00:21:43.237 --> 00:21:46.244
Hey,it's me. She's dead.
Burned up,just like you said.

00:21:47.306 --> 00:21:48.138
When?

00:21:48.138 --> 00:21:50.743
Minutes before I got here.
The smell hasn't even cleared.

00:21:50.743 --> 00:21:53.058
What's up with your visions?
This wasn't even a head start.

00:21:53.058 --> 00:21:55.894
I can't control them. I don't
know what the hell is going on.

00:21:55.894 --> 00:21:59.100
You were with andy when this whole
thing went down,so it can't be him.

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:00.694
It's got to be somebody else.

00:22:00.694 --> 00:22:01.736
That doesn't make any sense.

00:22:01.736 --> 00:22:04.802
What else is new? I'll dig around
here, see what else I can find.

00:22:10.113 --> 00:22:14.613
You get these premonitions
of people about to die?

00:22:15.946 --> 00:22:17.890
That's impossible.

00:22:19.834 --> 00:22:22.309
A lot of people would say the
same thing about what you do.

00:22:24.273 --> 00:22:25.926
Death visions? Yeah.

00:22:26.337 --> 00:22:27.991
Dude,that sucks.

00:22:27.991 --> 00:22:31.638
When I got my mind
thing, it was like a gift.

00:22:31.638 --> 00:22:33.081
It was like I won the lotto.

00:22:33.081 --> 00:22:35.787
But you still live in a van.

00:22:36.368 --> 00:22:39.565
I don't get it. You could
have anything you ever wanted.

00:22:40.878 --> 00:22:44.475
Yeah,but I-I got everything I need.

00:22:47.782 --> 00:22:49.556
So you're really not a killer,huh?

00:22:49.556 --> 00:22:52.512
That's what I've been
trying to tell you.

00:22:53.785 --> 00:22:55.618
That's good.

00:22:55.618 --> 00:22:57.913
That means there's hope for both of us.

00:23:05.178 --> 00:23:08.074
Victim's name was holly
beckett. 41. Single.

00:23:08.074 --> 00:23:10.489
Who is she? Never heard of her.

00:23:10.489 --> 00:23:13.185
I called ash on the way over. He
came up with a little something.

00:23:13.546 --> 00:23:17.755
Apparently holly beckett gave birth
when she was 18 years old,back in 1983 --

00:23:17.755 --> 00:23:20.129
Same day you were born,andy.

00:23:21.282 --> 00:23:23.677
Andy, were you adopted?

00:23:23.907 --> 00:23:24.879
Well,yeah.

00:23:24.879 --> 00:23:28.096
You were? And you
neglected to mention that?

00:23:28.447 --> 00:23:32.545
It never really came up. I mean,I
never knew my birth parents,

00:23:32.545 --> 00:23:36.494
And,like you said, my adopted
mom died when I was a baby.

00:23:36.494 --> 00:23:38.778
Do you think this holly
woman could actually be --

00:23:38.778 --> 00:23:42.947
I don't know. Tried to get a copy of the birth
records,but they're sealed in the county office.

00:23:44.300 --> 00:23:46.244
Well,screw that.

00:23:47.968 --> 00:23:50.202
Probably shouldn't have
let you kids in here.

00:23:50.202 --> 00:23:52.447
No. It'll all be fine, all right?

00:23:52.447 --> 00:23:55.143
Just go get a cup of coffee, all right?

00:23:55.533 --> 00:23:58.039
These aren't the droids
you're looking for.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:00.454
Awesome.

00:24:00.794 --> 00:24:02.117
I got it. Yeah?

00:24:02.117 --> 00:24:05.394
Yeah.

00:24:05.394 --> 00:24:07.468
Andy,it's true.

00:24:07.849 --> 00:24:11.156
Holly beckett was your birth mother.

00:24:12.839 --> 00:24:14.112
Does anyone have a vicodin?

00:24:14.112 --> 00:24:16.156
Dr. Jennings was her doctor,too.

00:24:16.156 --> 00:24:19.293
I mean, he oversaw the adoption.

00:24:19.644 --> 00:24:21.367
You have a solid
connection to both of them.

00:24:21.367 --> 00:24:24.003
Yeah,but I didn't kill
them. We believe you.

00:24:25.486 --> 00:24:28.091
Yeah. But,uh,who did?

00:24:28.091 --> 00:24:30.546
I think I got a pretty good guess.

00:24:31.528 --> 00:24:34.324
Holly beckett gave birth to twins.

00:24:35.567 --> 00:24:38.493
I have an evil twin.

00:24:39.204 --> 00:24:42.090
Holly put you and your
brother up for adoption.

00:24:42.090 --> 00:24:45.738
And you went to the
gallagher family,obviously,

00:24:45.738 --> 00:24:49.746
And your brother went to the
weems family from upstate.

00:24:51.179 --> 00:24:53.254
Andy,how you doing? Still with us?

00:24:55.168 --> 00:24:56.460
Um...what was my brother's name?

00:24:56.460 --> 00:25:00.138
Here. Um,ansem weems?

00:25:01.311 --> 00:25:03.866
He's got a local address. He lives here?

00:25:03.866 --> 00:25:05.539
Let's get a look at him.

00:25:05.539 --> 00:25:08.305
Got his picture coming
over from the dmv right now.

00:25:18.035 --> 00:25:20.881
Hate to kick you while you're freaked.

00:25:22.324 --> 00:25:24.268
Take a look at that.

00:25:28.217 --> 00:25:30.371
Hey,trace? Yeah?

00:25:32.025 --> 00:25:35.492
You and andy,you guys went
together for a while,didn't you?

00:25:36.053 --> 00:25:37.686
Yeah,webber,why?

00:25:37.686 --> 00:25:42.056
I don't know. Just wondering. I was
wondering how you felt about him these days.

00:25:42.056 --> 00:25:45.623
I mean,I've seen you guys together. It
seems like there's still something there.

00:25:47.246 --> 00:25:50.203
Were you guys ever, like,serious?

00:25:50.593 --> 00:25:52.407
Um...no.

00:25:52.407 --> 00:25:55.143
Come on,trace. Tell the truth.

00:25:58.109 --> 00:26:01.035
All right,andy,tell us everything
you know about this guy.

00:26:02.608 --> 00:26:07.859
I don't know much. Webber shows
up one day like eight months ago,

00:26:07.859 --> 00:26:10.014
Acting like he's my
best friend in the world.

00:26:10.014 --> 00:26:12.579
He's kind of weird,like
trying too hard,you know?

00:26:12.579 --> 00:26:14.303
He must've known you guys are twins.

00:26:14.303 --> 00:26:16.808
Why did he change his name?
Why not tell you the truth?

00:26:19.263 --> 00:26:20.826
Sam?

00:27:10.490 --> 00:27:11.843
Sam? Oh,god!

00:27:11.843 --> 00:27:13.767
Sam?!

00:27:14.158 --> 00:27:15.370
Sam!

00:27:18.366 --> 00:27:20.280
Hey. Hey!

00:27:32.716 --> 00:27:34.620
I take my ladies here.

00:27:36.484 --> 00:27:38.528
They like it.

00:27:39.440 --> 00:27:43.288
Well,I mean,I like it,
so,of course,they do,too.

00:27:46.926 --> 00:27:50.313
Please. I just want to go home.

00:27:50.313 --> 00:27:52.979
Stop crying.

00:27:54.822 --> 00:27:56.847
Hey.

00:27:58.961 --> 00:28:01.847
I get it. I see what you see in andy.

00:28:01.847 --> 00:28:05.144
I mean,he's a genius.
The books he reads --

00:28:05.144 --> 00:28:08.030
He's gonna be a great man someday.

00:28:10.966 --> 00:28:14.704
But he is my family, not yours.

00:28:15.445 --> 00:28:18.001
You can't have him.

00:28:18.001 --> 00:28:21.238
You're not gonna have
anything after tonight.

00:28:37.071 --> 00:28:38.343
Dean, you should stay back.

00:28:38.343 --> 00:28:41.480
No argument here. I had my head
screwed with enough for one day.

00:28:46.450 --> 00:28:49.747
I'm coming with
you. Andy --

00:28:49.747 --> 00:28:53.475
That's tracy out there, and I'm coming.

00:28:56.892 --> 00:29:00.129
Okay. Ch-Ch--
Slower.

00:29:04.798 --> 00:29:06.813
Tracy...

00:29:07.835 --> 00:29:11.142
I want you to listen to
me very carefully,okay?

00:29:12.996 --> 00:29:15.631
When we're done here

00:29:17.044 --> 00:29:22.225
I want you to head over to
the edge of that dam,okay?

00:29:24.319 --> 00:29:25.973
Okay.

00:29:27.596 --> 00:29:29.841
And when you get there

00:29:31.013 --> 00:29:33.488
You're gonna think you can fly.

00:29:35.723 --> 00:29:38.819
And you're just gonna step right off.

00:29:41.485 --> 00:29:44.090
You -You can fly,can't you?

00:29:46.606 --> 00:29:49.722
Yeah. I think so.

00:29:49.722 --> 00:29:51.466
You might get scared,

00:29:51.466 --> 00:29:55.344
But I want you to say that it's okay.

00:29:57.468 --> 00:30:02.930
Just tell yourself,
"everything is okay."

00:30:04.503 --> 00:30:06.718
Get out of the car! Now!

00:30:06.718 --> 00:30:09.083
You really don't want to do this.

00:30:10.956 --> 00:30:12.760
Trace,give me your hand.
Come here,come here.

00:30:12.760 --> 00:30:16.889
I couldn't control myself.

00:30:16.889 --> 00:30:19.855
Hey! Don't move. Don't move!

00:30:21.799 --> 00:30:23.453
No! No! I will kill you!

00:30:23.453 --> 00:30:24.976
Andy! Hey,hey,hey! No!
No! I'll handle this!

00:30:25.046 --> 00:30:28.303
I will kill you!

00:30:28.303 --> 00:30:31.159
Andy,listen to me! Just listen to me!

00:30:33.153 --> 00:30:36.840
Tracy,stop! I said,stop it!

00:30:48.284 --> 00:30:50.930
How did you do that? Practice,bro.

00:30:51.701 --> 00:30:54.257
If you just practiced, you would know.

00:30:54.257 --> 00:30:57.423
Sometimes... you don't
need to use your words.

00:30:57.423 --> 00:31:01.081
If you have to, all you need is this.

00:31:01.562 --> 00:31:03.105
Sometimes the headache is worth it.

00:31:03.105 --> 00:31:04.588
You twisted son of a bitch!

00:31:04.588 --> 00:31:07.815
Back off,andy! Or tracy is
gonna do a little flying.

00:31:15.401 --> 00:31:17.716
Aren't you,trace?

00:31:19.409 --> 00:31:22.596
I'm stronger than you. I can do it.

00:31:25.642 --> 00:31:28.308
Okay,okay. Okay.

00:31:28.308 --> 00:31:31.514
All right,just... please don't hurt her.

00:31:31.514 --> 00:31:34.731
Don't be mad at me,okay?
I know. It's all wrong.

00:31:34.731 --> 00:31:37.297
I didn't mean for this
to happen. It's just...

00:31:38.218 --> 00:31:40.433
Tracy
--

00:31:40.864 --> 00:31:43.229
She's trying to come between us.

00:31:43.229 --> 00:31:45.083
You're insane. She's garbage!

00:31:45.083 --> 00:31:46.846
Man,they all are!

00:31:46.846 --> 00:31:49.592
We can push them. We can
make them do whatever we want!

00:31:51.376 --> 00:31:54.462
Are you really -Are you
really this stupid? Is it --

00:31:55.444 --> 00:31:58.250
You learn you got a twin,

00:31:58.250 --> 00:32:00.776
You call him up, you go out for a drink.

00:32:00.776 --> 00:32:02.940
You don't start killing people!

00:32:02.940 --> 00:32:06.858
I wanted to tell you
for so long,bro,but...

00:32:08.281 --> 00:32:11.027
He didn't let me. He said I
had to wait until the time --

00:32:11.027 --> 00:32:13.452
Who? The man with the yellow eyes.

00:32:16.819 --> 00:32:17.971
What are you talking about?

00:32:17.971 --> 00:32:21.579
He came to me... in my dream.

00:32:23.052 --> 00:32:25.487
He said I was special.

00:32:25.958 --> 00:32:29.245
He told me he's got big plans for me.

00:32:29.245 --> 00:32:32.131
Wait till you see what's in
store,andy,for both of us.

00:32:33.564 --> 00:32:39.186
See,he's the one who told me
that I had a brother,a twin.

00:32:45.970 --> 00:32:48.054
Why did you kill our mother?

00:32:48.054 --> 00:32:49.748
And why dr. Jennings?

00:32:49.748 --> 00:32:52.463
Because they split us up!

00:32:53.105 --> 00:32:55.640
They ruined our lives, andy!

00:32:55.640 --> 00:32:58.787
We could've been
together this whole time

00:32:58.787 --> 00:33:01.402
Instead of alone.

00:33:02.093 --> 00:33:05.290
I couldn't let them do that. I
couldn't let them get away with that.

00:33:06.493 --> 00:33:08.296
No.

00:33:19.229 --> 00:33:21.895
I see you.

00:33:22.847 --> 00:33:25.152
Bye-Bye.

00:34:00.165 --> 00:34:02.469
He shot himself.

00:34:02.900 --> 00:34:05.416
And you all saw it happen.

00:34:06.778 --> 00:34:09.524
Yeah. We did.

00:34:10.326 --> 00:34:12.911
Look at him. He's getting better at it.

00:34:31.009 --> 00:34:32.953
She won't even look at me.

00:34:33.624 --> 00:34:35.909
Yeah, she's pretty shaken up.

00:34:35.909 --> 00:34:39.066
No,it's -This is different.

00:34:39.066 --> 00:34:41.200
This
is --

00:34:41.200 --> 00:34:45.649
I never used my mind thing on
her before,before last night.

00:34:48.125 --> 00:34:50.630
She's scared of me now.

00:34:55.249 --> 00:34:57.985
Andy,I hate to do this, but,um...

00:34:59.558 --> 00:35:02.214
We have to get out of here. Here.

00:35:02.685 --> 00:35:04.779
I wrote down my cell.

00:35:05.631 --> 00:35:11.443
You don't have to be alone in this,all right?
If anything comes up,you can call me up.

00:35:15.682 --> 00:35:20.993
Wh-What am I supposed to do now?

00:35:20.993 --> 00:35:23.348
You be good,andy...

00:35:23.759 --> 00:35:25.703
Or we'll be back.

00:35:33.690 --> 00:35:35.303
Looks like I was right.

00:35:35.303 --> 00:35:37.167
About what? Andy.

00:35:37.718 --> 00:35:40.143
He's a killer after all.

00:35:40.734 --> 00:35:43.711
No,he's a hero. He saved his
girlfriend's life. He saved my life.

00:35:43.711 --> 00:35:47.148
Bottom line, last night
he wasted somebody.

00:35:47.148 --> 00:35:49.823
Yeah,but he's not a
foaming-At-The-Mouth psycho.

00:35:49.823 --> 00:35:52.779
He was just -He was pushed into that.

00:35:52.779 --> 00:35:55.024
Webber was pushed,too, in his own way.

00:35:55.024 --> 00:35:57.770
Max miller was pushed. Hell,I
was pushed by jessica's death.

00:35:57.770 --> 00:35:58.802
What's your point,sam?

00:35:58.802 --> 00:36:01.548
Right circumstances, everyone
is capable of murder -Everyone.

00:36:02.640 --> 00:36:05.987
Maybe that's what the demon is doing
-Pushing us,finding ways to break us.

00:36:05.987 --> 00:36:08.683
We don't know what the demon wants,okay?

00:36:08.683 --> 00:36:10.787
Quit worrying about it.

00:36:11.789 --> 00:36:14.715
You know,I heard you before,dean,
when andy made you tell the truth.

00:36:15.246 --> 00:36:17.050
You're just as scared of this as I am.

00:36:17.050 --> 00:36:20.918
That was mind control! It's like
being roofied man. That doesn't count.

00:36:20.918 --> 00:36:23.674
No,I-I'm calling
do-Over. What are you,7?

00:36:23.674 --> 00:36:26.099
Doesn't matter. We just got
to keep doing what we're doing,

00:36:26.099 --> 00:36:28.294
Find that evil son of
a bitch, and kill it.

00:36:31.280 --> 00:36:33.264
Yeah. I guess.

00:36:35.779 --> 00:36:37.483
Hello?

00:36:38.345 --> 00:36:41.010
Ellen. What's going on?

00:36:43.124 --> 00:36:45.469
Yeah. We'll be right there.

00:36:52.374 --> 00:36:54.248
Jo?

00:36:54.248 --> 00:36:56.031
Go pull up another case of beer.

00:36:56.031 --> 00:36:58.276
Mom --
Now. Please?

00:37:01.773 --> 00:37:05.732
So,you,uh,you want to tell me
about this last hunt of yours?

00:37:06.794 --> 00:37:08.548
Nope. Not really.

00:37:10.622 --> 00:37:13.949
No offense. Just kind of a family thing.

00:37:14.540 --> 00:37:16.344
Not anymore.

00:37:17.246 --> 00:37:19.400
I got this stuff from ash.

00:37:21.484 --> 00:37:25.343
Andrew gallagher's house burned down on
his 6-Month birthday,just like your house.

00:37:26.054 --> 00:37:29.682
You think it was the demon both times,don't
you? You think it went after gallagher's family?

00:37:30.353 --> 00:37:31.776
Yeah,we think so. Sam.

00:37:31.776 --> 00:37:33.961
Why? None of your business.

00:37:34.301 --> 00:37:35.955
You mind your tongue with me,boy.

00:37:35.955 --> 00:37:37.989
This isn't just your war. This is war.

00:37:37.989 --> 00:37:41.496
Something big and bad is coming,and it's
coming fast,and their side holds all the cards.

00:37:41.496 --> 00:37:45.094
Now,at best,all we got is us -Together.

00:37:46.527 --> 00:37:48.932
No secrets or half-Truths here.

00:37:53.100 --> 00:37:55.285
There are people out there

00:37:55.285 --> 00:37:57.780
Like andy gallagher...

00:37:59.323 --> 00:38:01.769
Like me...

00:38:02.169 --> 00:38:04.564
And,um...

00:38:05.116 --> 00:38:07.330
We all have some kind of ability.

00:38:07.330 --> 00:38:08.974
Ability? Yeah.

00:38:08.974 --> 00:38:11.248
A psychic ability.

00:38:11.779 --> 00:38:14.325
Me,I have,um...

00:38:15.527 --> 00:38:17.842
I have visions...

00:38:18.273 --> 00:38:22.382
Premonitions. I don't know.
It's different for everybody.

00:38:24.957 --> 00:38:28.504
The demon said he had
plans for people like us.

00:38:28.504 --> 00:38:29.967
What kind of plans?

00:38:29.967 --> 00:38:31.190
We don't really know for sure.

00:38:31.190 --> 00:38:33.936
These people out there, these
psychics,are they dangerous?

00:38:33.936 --> 00:38:35.820
No.

00:38:35.820 --> 00:38:37.202
Not all of them.

00:38:37.202 --> 00:38:38.345
But some are. Some are very dangerous.

00:38:38.345 --> 00:38:39.698
How many?

00:38:39.698 --> 00:38:42.173
We've been able to track
a clear pattern so far.

00:38:42.173 --> 00:38:44.979
They've all had house fires on the
night of the kid's 6-Month birthday.

00:38:44.979 --> 00:38:47.083
That's not true.

00:38:47.825 --> 00:38:49.097
What?

00:38:49.097 --> 00:38:54.388
Webber or ansem weems or
whatever his name is --

00:38:55.761 --> 00:38:59.158
I looked at his files, and
there was no house fire.

00:38:59.549 --> 00:39:02.044
There's nothing out of the ordinary.

